# compact runtime glyphs.  Stored 0x1A becomes runtime 0x13 (hyphen), as in
# the retail Chu-Chu and Weltall-2 records; storing runtime 0x13 here instead
# becomes runtime 0x19, the digit 3, and displays ``El3Regulus`` in shops.
